# Tauri's generated capability schemas.
gen/schemas/
# gen/android is the Android project (Phase 0 of the Android app): its
# sources are kept; its own .gitignore files leave out the build outputs.
# gen/apple is the iOS project (Phase 0 of the iOS app, ADR 0119), the
# same way: its .gitignore leaves out Externals/, build/ and assets/.
